        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For, lo, the wicked bend ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bow, they make ready their arrow upon the string, that they may privily shoot at the upright in heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If the foundations be destroyed, what can the righteous do?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in his holy temple, the LORD’s throne ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in heaven: his eyes behold, his eyelids try, the children of men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD trieth the righteous: but the wicked and him that loveth violence his soul hateth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Upon the wicked he shall rain snares, fire and brimstone, and an horrible tempest: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the portion of their cup.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the righteous LORD loveth righteousness; his countenance doth behold the upright.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
